{"candidateAnswer":"Personal coaching and group instruction for dancers of different levels","evidence":"[D13:7 | 8:29 pm on 13 June, 2023] Jon: Besides the dance classes and workshops, I'm offering one-on-one mentoring and training to help dancers reach their full potential.\n[D8:13 | 1:26 pm on 3 April, 2023] Jon: Thanks, Gina! I'm expanding my dance studio's social media presence and offering workshops and classes to local schools and centers. I'm also hosting a dance competition next month to showcase local talent and bring more attention to my studio. All the work's paying off - I'm seeing progress and the dancers are so excited. It's such a great feeling to give a place where people can express themselves through dance!","itemId":"urn:uuid:fbe2f99f-2523-5eb5-a6af-a2ea3b86c1a0","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:1e29f8b1839d5c5c94fdd45a27f4720e8763230f9358505f4a08b16e6cca9bed","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What does Jon's dance studio offer?","referenceAnswer":"one-on-one metoring and training to dancers,  workshops and classes to local schools and centers","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"1e29f8b1839d5c5c94fdd45a27f4720e8763230f9358505f4a08b16e6cca9bed"}}]}